      "summary": "Discover active open-source repositories, compare GitHub activity and GSoC history, and track pull requests and issues from one dashboard.",
      "description": "SourceSurf helps developers find open-source projects using repository discovery, contributor analytics, and language breakdowns. The dashboard shows 12 months of contribution history and tracks GitHub issues and pull requests. Users sign in through GitHub or Google OAuth.\n\nThe Express API uses PostgreSQL and Drizzle ORM. Redis-backed BullMQ workers run background jobs with up to three retries and exponential backoff. A FastAPI service runs three scheduled jobs to collect GitHub data and sync repository metadata.",
