      ],
      "summary": "A Dockerized FastAPI service that collects GitHub Trending data for SourceSurf.",
      "description": "The scraper reads daily, weekly, or monthly GitHub Trending results and extracts repository owners, names, and stars earned during the selected period. It can scope the collection to a programming language.\n\nThree scheduled collection jobs keep SourceSurf's repository metadata current. The public scraper also provides a FastAPI endpoint for on-demand collection and forwards the resulting records to the SourceSurf backend.",
